@and_the_results
title: and the results
subtitle: This may be the end of the road...
on-arrival: zinoviev_letter = 1
  
The resolution was passed 364 to 198. This is it... MacDonald requests a dissolution of parliament the very next day. And a General Election is called.
  
 
